###1 Create car
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Skoda",
  "model": "Octavia",
  "year": "2025",
  "dailyPrice": "25000",
  "available": true
}

###2 Get all cars
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cars

###3 Get car by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cars/1


###4 UPDATE car
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/cars/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Audi",
  "model": "A6",
  "year": 2025,
  "dailyPrice": 30000,
  "available": false
}

###5 Delete car
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cars/1

###6 Validation error
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{
"brand": "",
"model": "Camry",
"year": 2024,
"dailyPrice": -100,
"available": true
}

###7 Not found error
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cars/9999

